{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Inspiring Smite",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Immediately after you deal damage to a creature with your Divine Smite feature, you can use your Channel Divinity as a Bonus Action and distribute temporary hit points to creatures of your choice within 30 feet of you, which can include you. The total number of temporary hit points equals 2d8 + your level in this class, divided among the chosen creatures however you like.</p>",
